# void ignore rules.
#
# void does not read .gitignore (it disables git ignore sources entirely), so
# this file is the authoritative ignore list for `void add` / `void status`.
# node_modules/, .git/, and .DS_Store are excluded by void itself.

# Build and tooling output
dist/
playwright-report/
test-results/
*.log

# Large binary assets. These are reproducible from the Unreal project via
# Scripts/export_forest_sector.py plus the conversion steps in
# docs/forest-sector-iteration-1.md, and total ~155 MB. They live on disk only.
public/assets/
assets-source/
